B.aa_=new A.ee("Is Khayt a real store?","No. Khayt is a fictional brand created for a portfolio project. Products, prices, reviews and orders are imaginary, and no payment is ever taken.")
B.a9W=new A.ee("How does the 3D viewer work?","The knitwear pieces are modelled in 3D right in your browser. Drag to rotate, tap a swatch to change colour, and notice that the whole store takes the colour you pick.")
B.a9M=new A.ee("Which payment methods do you accept?","Visa and Mastercard. At checkout the card form detects the brand as you type and runs a simulated 3-D Secure step. Use the test card 4242 4242 4242 4242 with any future date and any CVC.")
B.a9O=new A.ee("Is my card data safe?","In this demo your card details never leave the page. A live store would hand them directly to a PCI-compliant payment provider and never store them.")
B.a9U=new A.ee("How long does delivery take?","Standard delivery takes 3 to 6 business days and express 1 to 2 business days. Orders over $120 ship free.")
B.a9Z=new A.ee("What is your returns policy?","Free returns within 30 days of delivery for unworn items with their tags.")
B.a9Y=new A.ee("How do I choose my size?","Each product page lists its sizes. Knits run true to size; the Oversized Rib Knit is cut roomy, so take your usual size for the intended look or one size down for a closer fit.")
B.a9V=new A.ee("Is there a promo code?","Yes. Try KHAYT10 in your bag for 10% off.")
B.a9Q=new A.ee("Can I change or cancel an order?","Write to us within one hour of ordering and we will do our best to change or cancel it before it is packed.")
