B.a3G=s(['Khayt means "thread" in Arabic, and everything we imagine starts with one. A single honest thread, spun carefully, can become a sweater that lasts a decade.',"We are a fictional atelier, so we can say what we wish a real brand would: make fewer things, make them well, and tell people exactly what they are made of.","This store was built as a portfolio piece in Flutter: a full cart, card checkout, bilingual layout (English and Arabic, with real right-to-left support) and a knitwear viewer drawn from scratch in three.js with no 3D model files at all."],t.s)
